    "bounding box" : [ 29.667, 676.033, 285.0, 739.033 ],
    "font" : "GulliverRM",
    "font size" : 7.97,
    "text color" : "[0.0, 0.0, 0.0, 1.0]",
    "content" : "cocaine bolus ( Howell et al., 2001, 2002, 2009 ). Cocaine HCL was supplied by the National Institute on Drug Abuse (Research Technology Branch, Research Triangle Park, NC) and dissolved in 0.9% saline. Throughout this study the infusion rate and volume were held constant at 15ml/min and 4ml, respectively. This dose is expressed as the salt form."
  }, {
    "type" : "heading",
    "pdfua_tag" : "H1",
    "id" : 149,
    "level" : "Doctitle",
    "page number" : 1,
    "bounding box" : [ 300.667, 677.7, 343.333, 686.367 ],
    "heading level" : 1,
